number representing tenths of interline staff space (positive or negative). Both integer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and decimal values are allowed, such as 5 for a half space and 2.5 for a quarter space. Interline space is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"measured from the middle of a staff line."}]}}}